        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3465738161e146c2ba11e74d4f300445",
      "statement": "The severely adverse projection builds net income from PPNR minus provisions minus trading and counterparty losses, taxed at 22% with a benefit on losses. Buybacks are zero in every quarter, dividends are held flat (shares stay 1,381mm, common dividends 1,588.15 per quarter), and stress losses are top-down inputs from the enterprise stress testing program.",
