    {
      "id": "claim_31f63df95568444e8229c6d2d42b4ab3",
      "statement": "Key capital results: starting CET1 ratio 15.14%, baseline ending ratio 16.15% (Q3 2028), minimum stressed ratio 12.90% (Q3 2027), peak-to-trough decline 2.24%, and baseline excess CET1 versus the 13.0% target of 22,994.91 at Q3 2028. Stress headroom versus the management target is negative in Q2-Q4 2027, while headroom versus the regulatory requirement stays positive and the Summary flag reads YES.",
      "evidence": [
