    {
      "id": "claim_ea34ff891eed44468d4827953e2aa187",
      "statement": "The indicative SCB is MAX(2.5%, starting CET1 ratio minus minimum stressed CET1 ratio plus four quarters of baseline common dividends divided by starting RWA). With 2.24% decline and 0.94% dividend add-on it is 3.18%, so the 2.5% floor is not binding.",
