      "id": "claim_109c2aa35cc844d5bafb09cb1d700c0b",
      "statement": "The regulatory CET1 requirement is 4.5% minimum plus SCB plus 2.5% G-SIB surcharge: 10.20% with the current 3.20% SCB and 10.18% with the indicative 3.18% SCB. The management target is 13.0%. The workbook has no countercyclical buffer term.",
