      "id": "claim_af2135c576fe4e03b8e7ccc26d74d4f5",
      "statement": "The capital model is simplified: no AOCI volatility modelling, no deferred-tax-asset threshold deductions, and stress losses supplied top-down. It is owned by Corporate Treasury - Capital Management, validated by MRGR (last 2026-02-27, next due 2027-02-28), and takes inputs from API-16, API-14 and API-15.",
