    {
      "id": "claim_25097c616ef148bda615e420a6132576",
      "statement": "In the NII model, each line's repricing factor counts only 0-3m (repricing at month 1.5) and 3-12m (month 7.5) shares over a 12-month horizon. The NII effect per line is sign x balance x beta x factor x shock / 10000, with assets at beta 1, liability betas 0.45/0.75/0/1/1, and a static balance sheet. Change in NII is the sum, added to base NII of 50,236.91.",
      "evidence": [
