      "statement": "EVE uses modified-duration approximation (change = -dollar duration x shock / 100 summed over lines, liabilities with negative sign), independent of repricing buckets, expressed as a percentage of Tier 1 capital of 110,620. A -200 bp shock raises EVE by 2,737.40 (+2.47%) and a +200 bp shock lowers it by the same amount, against a 15.0% decline limit.",
