      "id": "claim_7acf21c97d4348d999932e149cea4db3",
      "statement": "The Summary limit flags are BREACH only when the NII change percent is below -7.0% or EVE percent of Tier 1 is below -15.0%; only declines are tested and all five scenarios read Within limit. Documented limitations are parallel shocks only, static balance sheet, no deposit-cost floors and constant betas, with a quarterly dynamic balance-sheet simulation in the ALM engine as compensating control.",
